x507 text "u32: an exact 32-bit unsigned integer; every arithmetic result wraps modulo 2^32. bool: true or false, never a number. Arrays u32xN and records (T,T,...) are values: get, set, at, and put return new values and nothing aliases. Array indices are taken modulo the length, so every access is total. io: a linear capability token for effects; each token value is used exactly once, so the data dependencies of the token are the effect order."
