x842 text "Static caps: 1024 functions, 4096 instructions per function, 64 parameters, arrays up to 1024 elements, literal iteration budget 2^24 per function. The reference evaluator has fuel; io output is bounded at 2^20 words. There is no heap, no recursion, and no unbounded loop, so a program cannot run away."
