x7492 text "Yes. Native output exports plain C-ABI symbols (a0_name), JavaScript output is an ES module with guarded exports, Java and C# outputs are ordinary classes, wasm32 exports functions and one io session entry. No runtime library to link."
x7493 puts x7491 x7492
x7494 call close x7493 
x7495 call close x7494 
x7496 call open x7495 5
x7497 write x7496 4
x7498 write x7497 2
