x7503 text "How big is the runtime?"
x7504 puts x7502 x7503
x7505 call close x7504 
x7506 call open x7505 2
x7507 write x7506 2
x7508 text "There is none. A native binary of the ten benchmark kernels is about 33 KB including the driver; the wasm for this whole page is under half a megabyte with every string and style rule inside it."
x7509 puts x7507 x7508
x7510 call close x7509 
x7511 call close x7510 
x7512 call open x7511 5
